## Title: |cffebad33SentiUI|r Blessings
## Notes: A PallyPower-compatible blessing window in SentiUI style: class rows with per-paladin assignments, missing-buff tracking, one-click blessing casts, aura/seal/righteous fury strip, symbols count and full PLPWR sync with real PallyPower clients.
